          "comment": "Won this on good ground in 2024 but conditions are not in his favour today",
          "spotlight": "Won this race on good ground under Becky Smith a year ago and defends his crown from a good mark but recent Flat/hurdling form has been underwhelming and conditions are not in his favour today.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-07-20",
              "horse": "Ashington",
              "horse_id": "hrs_11008879",
              "race": "Cartmel Female Jockeys' Handicap Hurdle (Pro/Am Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11323949",
              "course": "Cartmel",
              "course_id": "crs_234",
              "distance_f": "17",
              "distance_y": "3786",
              "quote": "I rode Ashington in this race last year when the ground was a bit softer and he still ran well, but he's off a lower mark this year and the ground's more suitable. Mark and the team have him in incredible form, he's been knocking on the door and I snapped up the chance to ride him - Becky Smith, rider, speaking to Racing TV."
            },
            {
              "date": "2018-06-28",
              "horse": "Ashington",
              "horse_id": "hrs_11008879",
              "race": "England V Belgium Betting At 188Bet Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_9151454",
              "course": "Newmarket (July)",
              "course_id": "crs_4524",
              "distance_f": "12",
              "distance_y": "2640",
              "quote": "Ashington was staying on well over a mile and a quarter last time and he really enjoyed this extra quarter mile - Andrea Atzeni, jockey."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's been a great horse, winning lots of prize-money without actually winning for us - but he's been placed nine times and has run regularly. He didn't stay 3m on soft ground at Hexham last time out, but he's well handicapped and one to watch on good ground back over hurdles. 14-06-24"
            }
          ],
