          "comment": "Below form at Uttoxter recently but runs this track very well; first-time cheekpieces",
          "spotlight": "Dual course winner; lightly raced in recent years but wasn't far off best form when keeping-on third here (3m1f, good to soft) in May; not at same level at Uttoxeter recently but still considered; first-time cheekpieces.",
