          "comment": "Not at best here last month but has claims if judged on other course form",
          "spotlight": "Never looked dangerous when modest third over C&D (good to soft) last month but this largely consistent 8yo won over C&D last spring and wasn't beaten far in a valuable 3m1f contest here in May; tongue-tie refitted.",
