          "comment": "Back in good nick over C&D last month, keeping on for second behind Judicial Review",
          "spotlight": "Six-time chase winner; probably a shade flattered by proximity to Judicial Review when keeping-on second over C&D (good to soft) three weeks ago but at least that run signalled a return to form; very versatile regarding ground; each-way claims at least.",
