          "comment": "Nothing like the force of old but both C&D runs this season were respectable",
          "spotlight": "Four course wins (one over C&D); very much on the downgrade now but both C&D runs this season were fairly respectable and he can't be ruled out off latest career-low mark; versatile regarding ground.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2022-06-01",
              "horse": "Jelski",
              "horse_id": "hrs_16424688",
              "race": "Remembering Nicholas Hooton Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_10544339",
              "course": "Cartmel",
              "course_id": "crs_234",
              "distance_f": "22",
              "distance_y": "4871",
              "quote": "They went too quick, they've gone a right gallop, Jelski sat last and it panned out perfectly for us. I hope the handicapper doesn't take it literally - Jimmy Moffatt, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-07-19",
              "horse": "Jelski",
              "horse_id": "hrs_16424688",
              "race": "Molson Coors Handicap Hurdle (Div I)",
              "race_id": "rac_10242661",
              "course": "Cartmel",
              "course_id": "crs_234",
              "distance_f": "22",
              "distance_y": "4871",
              "quote": "Jelski has dropped into the right grade. He was hard to saddle the last time here and I feel it upset him. He goes on soft ground too and will stay three miles - Jimmy Moffat, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's been a superstar. We bought him at the Trevor Hemmings dispersal sale in 2020 and he's won five times for us. He won two chases at Cartmel last summer and might need to come down the handicap a little bit, but he wins his races every year. He'll be out from springtime and we'll mix it between hurdles and fences. He's as good over hurdles as he is over fences. He's not the most scopey and has a neat way of doing things, but the smaller fences at Cartmel suit him well. 14-02-24"
            }
          ],
