          "comment": "Placed over 1m in last two starts and this drop back in trip should be fine; respected",
          "spotlight": "Won at Redcar (6f) and Ripon (1m) last summer and he's finished placed under prominent tactics at those tracks in last two starts; this drop back in trip is no problem and he's respected for in-form yard; both wins have been on good to firm but he has some form on soft.",
