          "comment": "Flopped in hat-trick bid over C&D latest but has claims if she can bounce back",
          "spotlight": "Reappeared with a win over C&D in April and she followed up with a comfortable success at Redcar (7f, good to firm); flopped in hat-trick bid over C&D two weeks ago but she still looks on a workable mark and could be a big factor if she can bounce back from that blip.",
