          "spotlight": "0-6 on the Flat but showed fair form; has taken really well to hurdling, winning handicaps at Huntingdon (2m, good to soft) and Ascot (1m7f, good; by 10l) in March; reappears off an 11lb higher mark but that looks fully justified and he promises to stay this longer trip; could complete a hat-trick.",
