          "comment": "Has an excellent course record and he's one who won't be inconvenienced by rain",
          "spotlight": "Last year's winner (on good) who enhanced his excellent record here with another victory last month; remains on a competitive mark and the ground was soft when runner-up in this two years ago.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-07-20",
              "horse": "Castel Gandolfo",
              "horse_id": "hrs_17762339",
              "race": "Unibet Daily Industry Best Prices Summer Handicap Hurdle (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_11324040",
              "course": "Market Rasen",
              "course_id": "crs_910",
              "distance_f": "16.5",
              "distance_y": "3645",
              "quote": "Castel Gandolfo has been around a while and placed here a lot. He was always finding one too good, but he felt great today and was working well. I got a grand run round and every split that I needed came. He toughed it out as I was there too soon, but I had to take the split on the rail as soon as I got it. When he landed at the last he rallied at the line. He loves it here so he's going to be coming back here soon I'd think. He could come back here for the Prelude meeting - Jonathan Burke, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2021-05-23",
              "horse": "Castel Gandolfo",
              "horse_id": "hrs_17762339",
              "race": "Fakenham Racecourse Caravan & Camping Site Is Open Maiden Hurdle (GBB Race)",
              "race_id": "rac_10173917",
              "course": "Fakenham",
              "course_id": "crs_468",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3523",
              "quote": "Castel Gandolfo is a mile/mile and a quarter horse on the Flat, there's some difference around here when you have a bit of speed because it's really tight, it worked out well today. It's lovely ground here and he loved it - Paddy Brennan, jockey"
            }
          ],
