              "distance_y": "3520",
              "quote": "I was pleasantly surprised by Sir Galahad. He wasn't a bad Flat horse. When I bought him off James Ferguson he said he was a lot better than he'd been showing. He's enjoyed his jumping. He tried hard, considering he was a maiden on the Flat. He might be an above-average summer horse - Olly Murphy, trainer."
