          "comment": "Will need to run better than at Uttoxeter last time when behind two of these",
          "spotlight": "Some fair efforts in defeat on the Flat this year but will need to run better than at Uttoxeter last time when behind two of these; tongue-tie joins regular cheekpieces.",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He has been a little unlucky not to win this year with three seconds, all at Lingfield. Last week he was a little disappointing but they crawled round and he needs a good pace, so when they quickened he was caught out. He will have a break now before coming back on the turf. I think he can win on the grass in fact he could be a better horse than on the all-weather. He seems versatile regarding trip, but I feel 1m4f in a true run race would be ideal for him, as when it is run slowly he gets a bit keen and is hard to settle. 29-03-21"
            }
          ],
