          "prev_owners": [],
          "comment": "Stable prolific in this race; well handicapped and should be all the fitter for latest run",
          "spotlight": "Strike-rate of 7-16 over fences and one of his defeats was a second in this two years ago on soft ground (overall record suggests a drier surface is preferred); well handicapped and his third to Charlie Uberalles at Cartmel was on the back of a long absence; that could have put him spot on for this, a race his stable has won eight times.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-05-26",
              "horse": "Courtland",
              "horse_id": "hrs_20471619",
              "race": "Dora Larner 92nd Birthday Celebration Handicap Chase",
              "race_id": "rac_10916165",
              "course": "Worcester",
              "course_id": "crs_2626",
              "distance_f": "20",
              "distance_y": "4400",
              "quote": "He's been out of form for a little while but dropped to a nice mark today. Courtland had a year off and took ages to come back but today he looked really well and he felt better, he travelled better, and won nicely - Sean Bowen, jockey, speaking to Sky Sports Racing."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-12-08",
              "horse": "Courtland",
              "horse_id": "hrs_20471619",
              "race": "Sky Sports Racing Sky 415 Handicap Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_10031385",
              "course": "Uttoxeter",
              "course_id": "crs_2184",
              "distance_f": "16",
              "distance_y": "3468",
              "quote": "We've loved Courtland from day one - he's a lovely, kind horse, so laidback and has a great attitude. We bought him as a foal in Ireland so to see him grow up and then go on to win races is very rewarding. His form has been well franked and hopefully he'll make into a nice chaser - Gwyn Brace, part-owner."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He had an injury after his last race, the bet365 Gold Cup at Sandown last April, but he's back in work and has done well. He'll probably have one run and then go straight to the Summer Plate at Market Rasen in July, a race in which he finished a very close second in 2023. 26-03-25"
            }
          ],
