          "comment": "Another win at Perth last time and was third in this 12 months ago",
          "spotlight": "Winning for a fifth time at Perth when going back-to-back in their Gold Cup (3m, good), again accounting for Hang In There; 5lb lower than when third in this last year (also third in it in 2022) and has soft-ground form if going back far enough.",
