          "prev_trainers": [],
          "prev_owners": [],
          "comment": "Under pressure a good way out but outstayed her rivals over 2m7f at Tipperary",
          "spotlight": "Under pressure a good way out but outstayed her rivals over 2m7f at Tipperary (yielding) on handicap debut over fences; that was on a par with the best of her hurdle form and she rates a likely contender.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-07-01",
              "horse": "Born Bright",
              "horse_id": "hrs_39021472",
              "race": "Adare Manor Opportunity Handicap Chase (Div II)",
              "race_id": "rac_11684335",
              "course": "Tipperary",
              "course_id": "crs_5252",
              "distance_f": "23",
              "distance_y": "5095",
              "quote": "It means the world to win with a homebred filly, and we've had this family for four or five generations. Born Bright was very unlucky at Limerick where she had a hard fall, and I think in Roscommon she was jumping big and slow and needed confidence. She wants good ground, and we might bring her over to Perth if we have to - Claire O'Connell, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-10-12",
              "horse": "Born Bright",
              "horse_id": "hrs_39021472",
              "race": "Adare Manor Opportunity Mares Maiden Hurdle",
              "race_id": "rac_11424972",
              "course": "Fairyhouse",
              "course_id": "crs_4732",
              "distance_f": "20.5",
              "distance_y": "4510",
              "quote": "That's fantastic and I'm delighted with Born Bright. She won a point-to-point and my son got to ride her in a few bumpers but she wants good ground and it went soft in Sligo and Listowel. This was a race that really suited and it was local. She'll run away over hurdles now - Claire O'Connell, trainer."
            }
          ],
