          "comment": "Won't mind returning to further but could do with the rain staying away",
          "spotlight": "Worcester winner last summer off 4lb higher (2m4f) but below that level since and merely stayed on at the one pace for a remote third at Bangor last month (2m4f); won't mind returning to further but could do with the rain staying away.",
