          "comment": "Improving fast on AW; best turf run came over C&D; needs more improvement at this level",
          "spotlight": "Fully effective on turf and his best effort on the grass came over C&D last May; flourishing on AW this year but only third behind Diligent Harry at Newcastle three weeks ago and he'll need another jolt of improvement to win.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-02-28",
              "horse": "Ferrous",
              "horse_id": "hrs_29227072",
              "race": "BetUK AWC Sprint Trial Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11536083",
              "course": "Lingfield (AW)",
              "course_id": "crs_10218",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1321",
              "quote": "Ferrous has done that well in a smart race. It's his first go round here and he took a bit of getting round the bend but he's in a great spot - Tom Marquand, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2022-11-05",
              "horse": "Ferrous",
              "horse_id": "hrs_29227072",
              "race": "Betonline At BetGoodwin Cock O'The North EBF Maiden Stakes (GBB Race) (Div I)",
              "race_id": "rac_10696608",
              "course": "Doncaster",
              "course_id": "crs_390",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1322",
              "quote": "We've had to wait a while for Ferrous as he's been slow maturing but he's worth waiting for. He did that well as he had to tough it out - Mick Channon, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He has started back really well, winning a 6f handicap at Lingfield in February. His form screams he's a better horse on the all-weather than turf, but I believe that's more down to circumstances than anything else. He's a little bit tricky to get spot on but I feel like we have him there at the moment. There are two big handicaps to target him at - one at Southwell on Sunday and one at Newcastle. We may look at something on the turf later on, maybe the Stewards' Cup or the Wokingham, but then he'll have an early break with a view to having him back for the all-weather again. 02-04-25"
            }
          ],
