          "comment": "Ended 2024 with a Group 1 win at Ascot (6f, soft); yet to fire in two runs this season",
          "spotlight": "Made fine progress last year, his first season of racing, culminating in a Group 1 win at Ascot on Champions Day (6f, soft); two lacklustre efforts so far this year, however, and needs a full revival.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-10-19",
              "horse": "Kind Of Blue",
              "horse_id": "hrs_40819555",
              "race": "Qipco British Champions Sprint Stakes (Group 1) (British Champions Series)",
              "race_id": "rac_11350066",
              "course": "Ascot",
              "course_id": "crs_52",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Kind Of Blue was unraced before the start of this season but has made giant strides and run some cracking races in defeat. He's improved with every race and there's no greater man than James Fanshawe to prepare a Champions Sprint winner here - he knows what he needs - James Doyle, rider."
            },
            {
              "date": "2024-09-07",
              "horse": "Kind Of Blue",
              "horse_id": "hrs_40819555",
              "race": "Betfair Sprint Cup Stakes (Group 1) (British Champions Series)",
              "race_id": "rac_11328525",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "It was a great run, I'm very pleased with Kind Of Blue. It looked like at the furlong pole we were going really well, but he's run a great race. He's come a long way and I think the bit easier ground helped him. He's getting the hang of it, he's a very exciting horse to have in the yard and I'd say there's a good chance we'll go to Ascot [on Champions Day] - James Fanshawe, trainer."
            }
          ],
