          "comment": "Promising and unexposed colt; whether 6f will be optimal is a query on his belated return",
          "spotlight": "Promising 2yo; only seen three times last year, showing useful form when fifth at Royal Ascot (1m, good to firm) and Goodwood (1m, good to firm; Group 3); still has some potential but the return to 6f isn't sure to suit on his return from 351 days off.",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He had a little hold-up this spring so I don't think he'll make the 2,000 Guineas. He showed up well on both starts, including when third in the Gimcrack after being drawn on the wing. He had an issue after that race, which is why he didn't run again. He's a big, strong lad and as he gets older things will become easier for him. I'm optimistic that given his size he should progress through the year. 15-04-24"
            }
          ],
