          "comment": "Had a fitness edge on Jarraaf and Russet Gold when winning at Salisbury in May; opposable",
          "spotlight": "Had a couple of today's rivals in behind when winning at Salisbury in May (6f, good to firm) but she was race fit on that occasion and has since been well held at Newcastle; others bring more obvious claims.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2024-07-07",
              "horse": "Fair Angellica",
              "horse_id": "hrs_37123625",
              "race": "Prix Amandine (Listed Race) (3yo Fillies) (Straight Course) (Turf)",
              "race_id": "rac_11341239",
              "course": "Deauville",
              "course_id": "crs_5356",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "We came here for a bit of black type and if Fair Angellica won it was only going to be a bonus. The way she shot clear on her last run at Kempton made me very concerned about the mile at Ascot, and she didn't stay. Ryan [Moore, jockey] said she could come back to six, certainly on softer ground. I've an eye on the Oak Tree [at Goodwood] but we'll see - Richard Hughes, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2023-10-14",
              "horse": "Fair Angellica",
              "horse_id": "hrs_37123625",
              "race": "Godolphin Flying Start Nursery Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_11043890",
              "course": "Newmarket",
              "course_id": "crs_988",
              "distance_f": "7",
              "distance_y": "1540",
              "quote": "David Egan said Fair Angellica was a bit gangly in the early stages but when she hit the rising ground she took off. That's it for this season I think and hopefully she can get some black type next year - Wendy Miller, owner."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "We're delighted with her. The ground was too quick at Glorious Goodwood and we couldn't take the chance. She was declared because there was rain forecast and it never appeared, but she seems in great form and Ryan Moore liked her when he won on her. She ran another good race when fourth in the Group 3 Sceptre Fillies' Stakes at Doncaster on Sunday. 18-09-24"
            }
          ],
