          "comment": "Well beaten at Royal Ascot but worth a second look in view of her Cheshire Oaks third",
          "spotlight": "Musselburgh maiden winner (1m4f, good to soft) who was third in a hot running of the Listed Cheshire Oaks in May (11.3f, good); well beaten in Group 2 Ribblesdale at Royal Ascot (1m4f, good to firm) but failed to settle and, in view of the penultimate form, is not ruled out now back down in grade.",
