          "comment": "Went close in big field at Chelmsford then underwhelming at York; retains potential",
          "spotlight": "Won last summer on first two starts (7f/1m, good/good to firm) and went close in big-field handicap at Chelmsford (1m, AW) last month on his fourth outing; underwhelming at York (1m, good) since and has to bounce back but remains lightly raced and is of interest on his previous form.",
          "quotes": [],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's very lightly raced but won his first two starts last year. His lack of experience going into handicaps for the first time has shown this year, as he's got to learn a bit, but he took a really nice step forward when he was second on his last run at Chelmsford. He was probably a bit unlucky with how the race panned out, but he was beaten only narrowly by an unexposed horse in Mr Swivell. He's a lovely, big, scopey horse and hopefully he can keep progressing. He's not the finished article. 11-06-25"
            }
          ],
