          "comment": "Small backward step at Epsom on Thursday and has to prove stamina going up in trip again",
          "spotlight": "Best run for this yard, having missed ten months and undergone wind surgery, on his first crack at beyond sprint trips early in the month; below that level at Epsom on Thursday and has to prove his stamina going up in distance again.",
