          "comment": "4lb rise leaves little wiggle room and David Allan has opted for Garden Oasis",
          "spotlight": "Looked to bump into one when a clear second at York last time; often run well in decent handicaps over the past year but a 4lb rise leaves little wiggle room and David Allan has opted for Garden Oasis.",
