          "comment": "Regressive veteran but retains sufficient ability to play a part at this level",
          "spotlight": "Getting on for two years since his last success and he's not the force of old; that is reflected in his mark though and he wasn't beaten far in a better race over C&D last month; each-way shout.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2023-08-19",
              "horse": "Roundhay Park",
              "horse_id": "hrs_10524024",
              "race": "William Hill Silver Trophy Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_10996284",
              "course": "Ripon",
              "course_id": "crs_1274",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "I was a bit shocked, but Roundhay Park does turn up every time and tries his heart out. It's lovely getting on such genuine horses. I was doing a rain dance last night as he does like it with a bit of soft in the ground. He's so genuine and kept on finding - Faye McManoman, jockey."
            },
            {
              "date": "2020-09-18",
              "horse": "Roundhay Park",
              "horse_id": "hrs_10524024",
              "race": "QTS Ayr Bronze Cup Handicap",
              "race_id": "rac_9945858",
              "course": "Ayr",
              "course_id": "crs_78",
              "distance_f": "6",
              "distance_y": "1320",
              "quote": "Roundhay Park was very relaxed today. He sometimes gets wound up but he came up yesterday and he's been very relaxed. He was given a great ride by Faye as there was no panic and no rush - Nigel Tinkler, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2017-07-18",
              "horse": "Roundhay Park",
              "horse_id": "hrs_10524024",
              "race": "Racing UK Novice Auction Stakes (Div II)",
              "race_id": "rac_8855548",
              "course": "Beverley",
              "course_id": "crs_156",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "Roundhay Park was a bit buzzy so I'll give him a bit of a break now - Nigel Tinkler, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "He's a lovely horse and has been a great servant for the yard. He was second in the Shergar Cup Sprint Cup years back under Hayley Turner and was a top-class handicapper in his heyday. He finished last of 11 at York on Friday and hasn't shown it in his last two starts but the handicapper has just got him high enough. He's a little bit older now and we could do with a bit of help from the handicapper. 27-07-22"
            }
          ],
