          "comment": "May remain competitive despite having gone up an aggregate 27lb for handicap hat-trick",
          "spotlight": "Has made great strides this year, bolted up at Carlisle (5f, good to soft) in May; defied a penalty at Thirsk (6f, good) before completing the hat-trick off his revised mark at Hamilton (5f, good); may remain competitive despite having gone up an aggregate 27lb",
