          "comment": "Four-time winner is unbeaten in two outings at this track, 5lb out of the handicap",
          "spotlight": "Won twice in a busy juvenile campaign; has trained on well, winning two sprint handicaps at this venue; more progress required now since she is 5lb out of the handicap.",
