              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "She likes passing horses. We went a good gallop today and Gazelle D'Or wasn't travelling great so I had no choice but to lie into her and hope the pace would quench and it did. When we started passing a few she came home smart - Wayne Lordan, jockey, speaking to Racing TV."
