          "comment": "2-2 at 5f this season, had Rumstar behind in Temple Stakes, Moore up, obvious chance",
          "spotlight": "British raider has won both starts at 5f this season, a Group 3 at Longchamp (gd-sft) and the Group 2 Temple Stakes at Haydock (Rumstar 4.5l behind in sixth); will be suited by a strongly run race and likely to get that here; connections have secured the services of Ryan Moore; obvious chance.",
          "quotes": [
            {
              "date": "2025-05-24",
              "horse": "Mgheera",
              "horse_id": "hrs_33149956",
              "race": "Betfred Temple Stakes (Group 2)",
              "race_id": "rac_11606946",
              "course": "Haydock",
              "course_id": "crs_598",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "Mgheera is a good sprinter and it's very exciting. We've got plenty of work into her, but she's always slowly away and that certainly wouldn't be a problem at Ascot. It should really suit her, especially that stiff five furlongs from being held up. There's a chance she might ship down to Australia after Ascot but we will have to persuade the owners to stay a bit longer as she would have a real chance in a Nunthorpe - Ed Walker, trainer."
            },
            {
              "date": "2025-05-11",
              "horse": "Mgheera",
              "horse_id": "hrs_33149956",
              "race": "Prix de Saint-Georges (Group 3) (3yo+) (Sprint Course) (Turf)",
              "race_id": "rac_11641903",
              "course": "Longchamp",
              "course_id": "crs_5486",
              "distance_f": "5",
              "distance_y": "1100",
              "quote": "It's quick ground out there and Mgheera loved it. Tom Marquand rode her at home and told me not to worry, she's got the action of a real fast-ground filly. Oisin [Murphy, jockey] nailed it. I was worried she was stuck behind [fourth home] Keran and that she wasn't going anywhere, but he wheeled out and got a lovely clean trip - Ed Walker, trainer."
            }
          ],
          "stable_tour": [
            {
              "quote": "She's in great nick and has done everything right since joining us from France for this season, winning at Longchamp and then in the Temple Stakes. I'm really excited to see her step up in grade. She'll have to improve again but you wouldn't rule it out. 10-06-25"
            }
          ],
