          "comment": "Sound efforts in heritage handicaps last twice, rated 93, a bit to find on stakes' debut",
          "spotlight": "Course winner at 1m4f (soft) comes into this on the back of two solid handicap efforts off 91 in the Chester Cup (18.5f, good) and off 93 in the Ascot Stakes (2m4f, gd-fm) when not quite seeing out the trip; his rating of 93 leaves him with a lot to find on his first start in stakes' company.",
